<title>UK: JG Summit sets $200 mln May 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>JG Summit sets $200 mln May 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JG SUMMIT PHILIPPINES LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    06.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    06.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625 PCT REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+180 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>DENOMS (K)ONE (REGS) SALE LIMITS US/UK/PH/HK/JP/SG</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  LISTING    LUX	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375 PCT SELL CONC  0.25 PCT  PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>		ISSUED UNDER THE $500 MILLION EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
